stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Ready for next admission
  s1: Carrier snapshot received
  s2: Authority checked
  s3: Admission denied
  s4: Checkpoint retained
  s5: Execution permitted
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: carrier supplies a snapshot
  s1 --> s0: restart with retained checkpoint
  s1 --> s2: verify independent authority
  s1 --> s3: verify independent authority
  s2 --> s0: restart with retained checkpoint
  s2 --> s3: storage fails closed or reject rollback or equivocation
  s2 --> s4: compare sequence and flush checkpoint
  s3 --> s0: restart with retained checkpoint
  s3 --> s1: carrier supplies a snapshot
  s4 --> s0: restart with retained checkpoint
  s4 --> s5: apply authenticated revocations
  s4 --> s3: apply authenticated revocations
  s5 --> s0: restart with retained checkpoint
  s5 --> s1: carrier supplies a snapshot
